Speech","speaker":"mori","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_unbreakablesphere2_05_e_31","text":"Yes, but Mana said it'll be fine as long as it's contained somehow, like in this glass bottle.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_unbreakablesphere2_05_e_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mori","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_unbreakablesphere2_05_e_32","text":"They were originally intending to use the AA Pillar to eliminate the crystals, but then Gluttony swallowed it and threw a wrench in the works.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_unbreakablesphere2_05_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"littlemermaid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_unbreakablesphere2_05_e_33","text":"So that's what the AA pillar was doing here in the first place...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_unbreakablesphere2_05_e_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mori","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_unbreakablesphere2_05_e_34","text":"I don't pretend to know all the details,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_unbreakablesphere2_05_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"mori","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_unbreakablesphere2_05_e_35","text":"but if we inject this into Gluttony's core, we can stop it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_unbreakablesphere2_05_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mori","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_unbreakablesphere2_05_e_36","text":"So let's be done with this, and get the hell out of here!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null